WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.223
Browse the feed. Text posts, photos, and articles appear together.

00:00:09.223 --> 00:00:14.932
Read a blog post. Open an article to read the full text on its own page.

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:24.523
Write a post. Type a caption, add photos, and see a preview as you write.

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:27.579
Publish and share. The published post has a URL you can share.

00:00:27.579 --> 00:00:31.796
See the new post. New posts appear at the top of your website’s feed.

00:00:31.796 --> 00:00:37.730
Light or dark. Readers can switch themes, or follow their system’s setting.
